# Steamworks: steam_api64.dll is Valve's SDK binary (redistribute only inside
# a build). steamworks/ and SteamworksPy64.dll are the MIT-licensed SteamworksPy
# wrapper, fetched per steam_integration.py. steam_appid.txt is a dev-only
# launcher aid Valve says not to ship. All optional at build time (see .spec).
steam_api64.dll
SteamworksPy64.dll
steam_appid.txt
steamworks/

# Windows reserved device name artifacts (left behind by "> nul" under Git Bash)
nul
